        {
            "id": "278623af-895c-4da0-83fa-41f5684c1fd3",
            "index": 3,
            "characterId": "779d6973-0d9e-4e35-907e-61399def5193",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_4022",
            "content": {
                "en": "Are they blocking your way?",
                "zh": "啊，挡着您路了吗？",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 293.0,
            "positionY": -323.0,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "867f8c1f-8ec9-44b3-a373-4b1b7ad850bc",
            "index": 4,
            "characterId": "779d6973-0d9e-4e35-907e-61399def5193",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_4023",
            "content": {
                "en": "(The vendor leans on a cane, one foot still in a cast.)",
                "zh": "（摊主拄着拐杖，一只脚上还打着石膏。）",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 670.0,
            "positionY": -322.0,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "b7f32d01-389d-4597-9ee2-e3e7d8237a82",
            "index": 5,
            "characterId": "779d6973-0d9e-4e35-907e-61399def5193",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_4024",
            "content": {
                "en": "I twisted my ankle in an accident a couple of days ago. My family’s been busy preparing other stalls, so they haven’t had time to come help.",
                "zh": "前两天因为意外扭伤了脚，家里人都忙着别处店铺的准备，抽不开身来帮忙。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 1022.0,
            "positionY": -319.0,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "6d150be3-4fd9-4e8a-9f34-4d4b1ea77abf",
            "index": 6,
            "characterId": "779d6973-0d9e-4e35-907e-61399def5193",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_4025",
            "content": {
                "en": "So I’ve had to set things up on my own, bit by bit.",
                "zh": "我只好自己慢慢悠悠架摊子，还好相邻的摊主们帮了我不少忙，现在也就差这点花灯没挂上了。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 1390.0,
            "positionY": -316.0,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "useTextId": true,
                    "textId": "ch1_4026",
                    "text": {
                        "en": "Maybe I could help…",
                        "zh": "也许我可以帮忙...",
                        "ja": ""
                    },
                    "conditions": [],
                    "conditionLogic": 0
                },
                {
                    "useTextId": true,
                    "textId": "ch1_4027",
                    "text": {
                        "en": "Could you move these out of the way?",
                        "zh": "您能把这些挪开吗",
                        "ja": ""
                    },
                    "conditions": [],
                    "conditionLogic": 0
                }
            ],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "edfd6cf9-4fc2-4609-9813-21d3134daf11",
            "index": 7,
            "characterId": "547590f1-5207-4943-a81f-41ae946214ce",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_3102",
            "content": {
                "en": "(I can’t just keep waiting like this. According to the info I had, the troupe should also have a stall at the fair.)",
                "zh": "（这样等下去也不是办法，根据之前的情报，戏团应该在大会会场也有摊位。）",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": -70.0,
            "positionY": -1482.0,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "a1c6a496-0523-4864-985a-3929d2046522",
            "index": 8,
            "characterId": "547590f1-5207-4943-a81f-41ae946214ce",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_3103",
            "content": {
                "en": "(I want to find their stall as soon as possible and see if I can gather some important information.)",
                "zh": "（我想尽快找到它们的摊位，看看能不能收集到比较重要的信息。）",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 248.0,
            "positionY": -2039.0,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "bf10b53e-2e01-4687-b6f7-31c3f059c444",
            "index": 9,
            "characterId": "c5690423-74d1-4bca-8967-89da828b1a25",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_3104",
            "content": {
                "en": "Well, how about I help you hang the lanterns?",
                "zh": "嗯，不如由我来帮您把花灯挂上吧。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 620.0,
            "positionY": -2037.0,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "d47396f4-74bf-4acf-ade3-f3860d31cd40",
            "index": 10,
            "characterId": "d5be2dcf-87aa-4ebc-afce-674209069707",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_4028",
            "content": {
                "en": "Then let me help you hang the lanterns.",
                "zh": "那我来帮您把花灯挂上吧。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 1883.0,
            "positionY": -679.0,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
